WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.005
-[sniffing]
-[dog barking]

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:08.049
Her scent is fresh. She's here.

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.386
If I could just get
my infrared mode to work…

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.515
[scanner whirring]

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.187
That's not right.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.774
Damn it,
now everything's in black and white.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.193
[gasps]

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.699
Her trail ends right…

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.581
[shimmering sound]

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.582
…here.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.879
My fruit! My beautiful fruit!

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.382
[thrusters whooshing]

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.303
[Saki gasps]

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.770
Got you.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:04.606
Don't touch me. You took my mom away.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.774
You're monsters!

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.568
Oh, sweet child, you think that was us?

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.488
I got her.

00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:16.409
[blaster whirring, fires]

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.911
[Saki grunts]

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.623
[all gasping]

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.506
[gasping]

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.424
[dynamic electronic music plays]

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.135
[shouting, gasps]

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.935
[blaster whirring, fires]

00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:45.146
[grunts, panting]

00:01:47.982 --> 00:01:49.317
Nowhere to go now.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.871
Okay, one where to go.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:07.794
Where is she?

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:08.878
In that wagon.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:10.630
Or, uh, that one.

00:02:10.713 --> 00:02:13.133
Or, no, that-- No.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:18.388
-Do you smell anything?
-[Nikita] Fish. Only fish.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.306
So, we lost her?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.808
[grunts] You lost her.

00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:23.351
[rapid beeping]

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.562
Ooh! My infrared's working.

